    </header>
    <div class="deliver-grid">
      <article><h3>Consultants and agencies</h3><p>Project invoices, client TDS, and possibly foreign clients. See {% routeLink "/industries/accounting-for-consultants/", "accounting for consultants" %}.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Clinics and health practices</h3><p>Patient billing, staff and equipment. See {% routeLink "/industries/accounting-for-clinics/", "accounting for clinics" %}.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Law and professional firms</h3><p>Fees, client expenses and confidentiality. See {% routeLink "/industries/accounting-for-lawyers/", "accounting for lawyers" %}.</p></article>
      <article><h3>IT and electronics traders</h3><p>Stock with serial numbers, warranty claims, dealer credit and thin margins. See {% routeLink "/industries/accounting-for-traders/", "accounting for traders" %} and the {% routeLink "/locations/accounting-services-in-nehru-place/", "Nehru Place page" %}.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Small head offices</h3><p>A registered office here with work elsewhere can mean multi-state GST questions.</p></article>
